      ],
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_cannot_be_controlled_by_adversary",
      "impact_statement": "Integer overflows in musl regcomp() with an untrusted regular expression (fixed in musl 1.2.7 / Alpine 1.2.6-r6, not yet available for Alpine 3.24). The JVM does not use libc regcomp(): Java regular expressions are implemented in java.util.regex. No libc-regex tool (busybox grep/sed/awk) is invoked at runtime; the container only runs the JVM, so no attacker-supplied pattern can reach regcomp()."
    },
